        <h2>Which releases this covers</h2>
        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table>
            <thead><tr><th>Release</th><th>Schema</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
<tr><td>2026-10 onward</td><td>All 44 columns, as listed below.</td></tr>
<tr><td>2026-08 and 2026-09</td><td>The first 40 columns. <code>RegionCode</code>, <code>CityNameAscii</code>, <code>CityGeonameId</code> and <code>CityFeatureCode</code> were appended in 2026-10.</td></tr>
<tr><td>2026-06 and 2026-07</td><td>The same column names, without the cloud, VPN and threat-intelligence columns.</td></tr>
